# Tour level Hill Country (data/tour.json), a 2-minute run from the top of Dolores: two of its goals,
# the tape and S-K-A-T-E (Upper Market at 56 is tour-hills-twinpeaks, from the level's other start).
# - Down Dolores crouched, the pop at the crest at 19th: SENT IT ON DOLORES (the goal Dolores Crest Air),
#   S and K on the way, then two powerslides to scrub speed.
# - Twin Peaks, at the curve at 19th at 11 m/s, an ollie: 19th Street Curve Air.
# - At the crest at Market and Clayton, an ollie at 11 m/s (the tape hung over this crest until phase
#   28; this air no longer reaches it).
# - Below the crest at 19th on Dolores, a boneless beside the parked car (city phase 11 parked it 3 m
#   further down than phase 28 first found it) and a BS 50-50 along its roof:
#   the tape is on the roof (phase 28: a find), ROOF GRIND (Roof Grind a Hybrid), and the combo takes the
#   run past Pro.
# - Dolores again with the rider-line autopilot (slower): A, T and E.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run level hills
hold up 20..200
hold ollie 200..900
hold ollie 902..1664
hold slide 1220..1290
hold slide 1560..1630
cmd 2000 teleport -1429.4 -368.7 73.75 5.6
cmd 2010 set skater.vel.x 1.07
cmd 2010 set skater.vel.y 10.95
hold ollie 2010..2040
cmd 2400 teleport -1325 -501.6 86.75 301.9
cmd 2410 set skater.vel.x -9.34
cmd 2410 set skater.vel.y 5.81
hold ollie 2410..2440
cmd 2700 teleport -205.12 -250.77 14.8 355.5
cmd 2702 set skater.vel.x -0.3138
cmd 2702 set skater.vel.y 3.9877
hold ollie 2784..2814
tap up 2802
tap up 2809
tap grind 2852
hold right 2853..2860
hold left 2890..2897
cmd 3100 teleport dolores_bomb
bot line dolores_bomb_line 3106
run 14700
expect event levelStart{level=hills,seconds=120} within 0..2
expect event letter{letter=S,have=S____} within 679..683
expect event letter{letter=K,have=SK___} within 1063..1067
expect event gap{id=doloressend} within 1030..1034
expect event levelGoal{level=hills,id=crest,name=Dolores Crest Air} within 1030..1034
expect event levelGoal{level=hills,id=curve,name=19th Street Curve Air} within 2150..2154
expect no event tapeFound within 0..2699
expect event tapeFound{level=hills} within 2860..2864
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 50-50,line=car_-206_-245} within 2851..2855
expect event levelGoal{level=hills,id=pro,name=Pro Score} within 2990..2994
expect event letter{letter=E,have=SKATE} within 5206..5210
expect event levelGoal{level=hills,id=skate} within 5206..5210
expect event levelOver{level=hills,score=5660,tape=true} within 14399..14402
expect session.levelGoals.length == 5 at end
expect no event levelWrongWay
expect no event bail
